  "content": "\n\n<h1>工厂方块</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要 Chisel</a>,<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/athena\" rel=\"nofollow\">推荐安装 Athena</a> 以支持连接纹理</p>\n<p>或者<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped\" rel=\"nofollow\">支持 Chipped</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">推荐安装 Continuity</a> 以支持连接纹理</p>\n<p>此外，是的，你可以同时使用 Chisel 和 Chipped，Athena 和 Continuity 同理。</p>\n<h2>图片展示</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ncc4gIn.gif\" alt=\"演示\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Lc34uAS.png\" alt=\"合成\"></p>\n<h3>Chisel 物品栏预览：</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Kh8h2jS.png\" alt=\"方块\"></p>\n<h3>Chipped 物品栏预览：</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ht0eTMEs/images/3ffff922199af42053d4f612db95640d82828b39.png\" alt=\"Chipped 方块\"></p>",
